# <NAME>

A new Jekyll + Markdown site, served at `/<NAME>/`.

Replace this paragraph with a one-sentence card description after you know what you're building.

## Add content

Drop Markdown files in this directory (or in subfolders) — each `.md` with YAML
front matter becomes a page. This `README.md` is the site index (`permalink: /`).
Set the site title, description, and theme in `_config.yml`.

## Run

`jekyll@<NAME>.service` runs the local preview at boot. To restart manually:

```bash
sudo systemctl restart jekyll@<NAME>.service
journalctl -u jekyll@<NAME>.service -f
```
